The baby V I was looking in
the mirror and I was like,

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:24.970
Christie, do I look...

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:28.040
It makes my neck look so tall
and my hair is getting bigger

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.573
so now just look skinny.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:31.840
I don't know, go to mythical.com

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.990
to wear stuff that makes you just right.

