"Rhett looks a little more homeless,"

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:52.620
or whatever the word they use was,

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:56.010
and Link looks smaller and skinnier.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:58.890
But I looked at it and I think
it's just your hair's bigger.

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:01.290
And you're also kind of
like turned to the side.

